id: SAFE30-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: secret_scan
target: crates/core/src/secret_scan.rs
find:     let proj = ["sk-proj-", "sk-svcacct-", "sk-admin-"];
replace:     let proj = ["sk-proj-", "sk-svcacct-"];
expect-fail: every_prefix_of_the_added_shapes_is_detected
note: sk-proj- 形式の接頭辞のうち 1 つを落とす（接頭辞ごとの検出が欠ける。SAFE-30）
